As requested I've added my fixes and requests to the google code Dynamica Project. I've included SVN Patches for the code changes.<br><br>The fix to make btBulletWorldImporter remove objects from its DynamicWorld before deleting them is here...<br><a href="http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/issues/detail?id=16" class="postlink">http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/issues/detail?id=16</a><br><br>The crash fix for btGimpactTriangleMeshShapes when loaded from btBulletWorldImporter is here...<br><a href="http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/issues/detail?id=17" class="postlink">http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/issues/detail?id=17</a><br><br>My game friendly feature requests are here...<br><a href="http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/issues/detail?id=18" class="postlink">http://code.google.com/p/dynamica/issues/detail?id=18</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=7272">VicariousEnt</a> — Tue Feb 15, 2011 2:40 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
